    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Your fleet has moved into an Asteroid Field. Anyone shooting at you, or anyone you attack, has a penalty of two Electronic Warfare points, which basically reduces every individual attack card used by two points. (Tholian ships cannot be attacked at all when in an asteroid field, but can attack at the penalty stated.) This electronic warfare can be countered by an ECCM card, or by a scout. Cloaks cannot be used by a fleet inside an Asteroid Field."
